      "text": "STRAND 1: HISTORICIST PM               STRAND 2: DECONSTRUCTIVISM\n(Venturi, Moore, Graves, Johnson)       (Gehry, Hadid, Koolhaas,\n                                         Libeskind, Eisenman, Tschumi)\nBring history back.                    Fragmentation, not history.\nReintroduce ornament, reference,        Geometry broken, displaced,\nirony, symbolism.                       non-orthogonal. Derrida.\nBuilding = communication.               Building = critique of certainty.\nDecorated shed (Venturi).               CATIA enables complex curves."
    },
