      "text": "STRAND 3: CRITICAL REGIONALISM         STRAND 4: HIGH-TECH\n(Frampton, Siza, Murcutt, Ando)        (Foster, Rogers, Piano)\nResist placeless modernism.             Celebrate structure + services.\nUse local material, topography,         Machine aesthetic. Visible\nclimate, culture as design generators.  ducts, columns, bracing.\nNot style imitation — thoughtful local  Pompidou Centre, Lloyd's.\nresponse."
    },
