      },
      "text": "TIMELINE:\n1966  Venturi \"Complexity and Contradiction\" — the shot fired\n1972  Learning from Las Vegas (Venturi/Scott Brown/Izenour)\n1972  Pruitt-Igoe demolished (Jencks's \"death of Modern Architecture\")\n1977  Jencks \"The Language of Post-Modern Architecture\"\n1978  Portland Building competition won by Michael Graves\n1982  Portland Building completed — historicist PM's flagship\n1984  AT&T Building (Chippendale pediment skyscraper), NYC\n1988  MoMA \"Deconstructivist Architecture\" exhibition\n1997  Guggenheim Bilbao (Gehry) — \"Bilbao effect\" coined\n2003  Pritzker Prize: Jorn Utzon (Sydney Opera) — 30 years late\n```"
