      "text": "THESIS: \"I like complexity and contradiction in architecture.\"\n  — This is a manifesto sentence in opposition to Mies's \"less is more\"\n  — Both/and instead of either/or.\n  — Good architecture has multiple meanings, not singular clarity."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-POSTMODERNISM.md#013",
      "path": [
        "07-POSTMODERNISM.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
