      "text": "THE STRIP (Las Vegas, 1966 research):\n  Buildings set back from the road behind parking lots\n  The building is invisible from the car at highway speed\n  What communicates: the SIGN\n  Giant signs, neon, billboards — the symbolic front\n  The building behind is a \"shed\" (cheap, functional box)\n  The communication is applied to the shed"
    },
    {
