      },
      "text": "DUCK vs. DECORATED SHED:\n  DUCK: The building's form IS its symbol.\n    The building shaped like a duck selling duck food.\n    Form = symbol. The symbol IS the architecture.\n    Gordon Wu Hall (Brown University) — building shaped like a\n    traditional building = duck architecture.\n    Falling Water, Ronchamp = duck (form is the message)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-POSTMODERNISM.md#021",
