      },
      "text": "DECORATED SHED: A conventional building + applied symbol.\n    The shed is functional. The decoration communicates.\n    Medieval cathedral: the architecture is a shed + symbols\n    (rose window, tympanum sculpture, statuary program) applied.\n    The Strip casinos: box + giant sign = decorated shed.\n    MOST ARCHITECTURE IS DECORATED SHED."
    },
