      "text": "Venturi's argument: decorated shed is NOT inferior.\n  It is the honest acknowledgment that communication\n  and structure are different problems with different solutions.\n  Modernism tried to make the duck (every building should be\n  its own symbol through form) — and failed most of the time."
    },
