      "text": "VOCABULARY:\n  Rusticated base (painted blue): references classical base\n  Keystone ornament: giant abstracted keystone over entry\n  Garland swags: applied decorative motifs (abstract, not literal)\n  Color: terracotta, blue, turquoise — not the gray/white of modernism\n  Portlandia statue: hammered copper female figure, 8m tall, above entry"
