      "text": "CRITICAL RECEPTION:\n  Modernist critics: garish, nostalgic, postcard architecture\n  Postmodern critics: brave, communicative, breaks the monotony\n  Public: divided, mostly liked the color and ornament\n  Philip Johnson: \"a major breakthrough\"\n  Ada Louise Huxtable (NYT): \"an ambitious failure\""
