      "text": "STRUCTURAL REALITY:\n  Steel frame with thin cladding (standard office building construction)\n  The ornamental elements are applied to the cladding\n  This IS the decorated shed Venturi described — and Graves was\n  explicitly demonstrating it. The ornament is not structural.\n  This is precisely the \"honesty\" modernism would reject.\n  For Graves: decorating a shed is fine. Sheds need decorating."
