      "text": "2020 RENOVATION:\n  The building was in serious disrepair (glass panels deteriorating,\n  mechanical systems failing). Major renovation completed 2020.\n  The renovation preserved and restored the ornamental vocabulary.\n  The building turned out to need $195M in repairs 38 years after\n  opening — the thin cladding system was not durable.\n  Irony: modernist curtain walls also had durability problems.\n```"
